// Interface languages for PRIVATE OS and NOVA OS.
// Each entry is keyed by its English text and lists the other seven languages in the order of
// LANGUAGES (fr, es, de, pt, it, ar, tr). An entry with eight strings starts with its own English
// text, for when two places share an English word but need different translations.
// TypeScript checks that every entry has all its languages and that t() only gets known keys.
// Brand names (PRIVATE OS, NOVA OS, Comet, Private Word...) are never translated.

